// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
//
// Llama-3.1-8B Q4NX verify gate: top-k token-level inclusion check, NPU q4nx vs
// HF bf16, 2 prompts × 32 greedy tokens, k=5 (use `make verify-full` for the
// full sweep locally). Exercises the full production prefill + decode path
// through the verify subsystem (verify/verify_runner.py); NPU weights come from
// the FastFlowLM model.q4nx bundle, the reference from the HF bf16 checkpoint.
//
// Skips cleanly when HF_TOKEN is unset (reference + tokenizer downloads need it).
//
// `make compile-decode` is mandatory here, not an optimization: it is what builds
// the decode templates this example runs on, into this example's own directory.
// (Every model emits the same decode_L<N>.* names, which is why they are kept
// per-example rather than in the shared fused_decode dir.) It needs an llvm-link
// from LLVM <23, hence llvm_link_pre23 below.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, llvm_link_pre23, hf_token, hfweights_nousresearch_meta_llama_3_1_8b_instruct, hfweights_fastflowlm_llama_3_1_8b_npu2
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_verify
// RUN: cd test_peano_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile-decode PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile verify PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [verify] PASS
